      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MADRID (1) impressed when posting a dominant 19.56 over 352m at this track three back then has hit the frame in both runs since. Looks the one to beat on best figures. CAMBLA BLISS (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (20.08) at this track behind Disco Ethics in a Mix 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Leading player again. SWEET EMBRACE (3) is a well performed dog who recorded her 7th career win last time out at Q Straight (16.53). Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Should feature again. LAKODA FOCUS (7) placed last start from this box and is in the mix again.",
